WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.576
The Guardian button opens the window for repairs, history and compliance.

2
00:00:06.076 --> 00:00:12.690
Under Sources, enter the files or folders that contain links: HTML, Markdown, WordPress export or sitemap.

3
00:00:13.191 --> 00:00:19.181
Press Analyze: Guardian finds scheme typos, tracking parameters and http links.

4
00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:28.635
Each proposal shows its rule and old → new address. “?” means not verified live, “✓” means verified.

5
00:00:36.418 --> 00:00:43.032
You can also add a manual replacement: type the old and new address and press Add proposal.

6
00:00:48.776 --> 00:00:54.718
Apply the selection: Guardian makes a backup and changes only the link’s bytes.

7
00:00:55.218 --> 00:01:01.256
The Log / undo tab lists every change, and “Undo last run” brings back the original text.

